### E-Wallet Week 6 — REST Client (VS Code "REST Client" / Rider / Visual Studio)
### Jalankan dulu: dotnet run --project src/Ewallet (Development)
@base = http://localhost:5000/api

### ---------- Payment methods ----------
GET {{base}}/payment-methods

### ---------- Users ----------
GET {{base}}/users

###
GET {{base}}/users/1

### Create user -> otomatis wallet ACTIVE saldo Rp0
POST {{base}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "joko_w", "fullName": "Joko W", "email": "joko@example.com", "phone": "081299990000" }

### Update user
PUT {{base}}/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fullName": "Budi Santoso", "email": "budi@example.com", "phone": "081200000001" }

### ---------- Wallet ----------
# Saldo SEBELUM transaksi (catat rowVersion)
GET {{base}}/wallets/7

### ---------- Top up ----------
# 1) Request: TopUpRequest + Transaction PENDING, saldo belum berubah
# @name topup
POST {{base}}/topups
Content-Type: application/json

{ "walletId": 7, "paymentMethodId": 2, "amount": 200000 }

### 2) Konfirmasi (Development/Testing saja): PAID + SUCCESS + mutasi IN + audit TOPUP_PAID
POST {{base}}/topups/{{topup.response.body.id}}/confirm

### 3) Konfirmasi ulang -> 409 (tidak boleh diproses ulang)
POST {{base}}/topups/{{topup.response.body.id}}/confirm

### Saldo SESUDAH top up
GET {{base}}/wallets/7

### ---------- Transfer ----------
# Sukses: 1 Transaction + 2 WalletMutations
POST {{base}}/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "senderWalletId": 7, "receiverWalletNumber": "EW1000000008", "amount": 50000, "description": "bayar makan" }

### Ditolak: saldo tidak cukup -> 400 + audit TRANSFER_REJECTED
POST {{base}}/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "senderWalletId": 8, "receiverWalletNumber": "EW1000000007", "amount": 99999999 }

### Ditolak: transfer ke wallet sendiri -> 400
POST {{base}}/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "senderWalletId": 8, "receiverWalletNumber": "EW1000000008", "amount": 1000 }

### ---------- Rollback ----------
# Gagal setelah saldo & mutasi ditulis, sebelum commit -> 500, saldo kedua wallet TIDAK berubah
POST {{base}}/transfers?simulateFailure=true
Content-Type: application/json

{ "senderWalletId": 1, "receiverWalletNumber": "EW1000000002", "amount": 10000 }

### ---------- Concurrency (RowVersion) ----------
# 1) Ambil rowVersion wallet 1
GET {{base}}/wallets/1

### 2) Ubah saldo wallet 1 (rowVersion di DB berubah)
POST {{base}}/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "senderWalletId": 1, "receiverWalletNumber": "EW1000000002", "amount": 1000 }

### 3) Kirim dengan rowVersion LAMA dari langkah 1 -> 409 Conflict, tidak ada perubahan
POST {{base}}/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "senderWalletId": 1, "receiverWalletNumber": "EW1000000002", "amount": 1000, "senderRowVersion": "GANTI_DENGAN_ROWVERSION_LANGKAH_1" }

### ---------- History (LINQ: search, filter, sort, pagination) ----------
GET {{base}}/wallets/1/transactions?page=1&pageSize=2

###
GET {{base}}/wallets/1/transactions?type=TRANSFER&direction=OUT&sortBy=amount&sortDir=desc

###
GET {{base}}/wallets/1/transactions?search=TOP-SEED&status=SUCCESS&from=2026-11-01&to=2026-11-30

###
GET {{base}}/wallets/7/mutations?direction=IN&page=1&pageSize=5

### ---------- Audit logs ----------
GET {{base}}/audit-logs?page=1&pageSize=10

###
GET {{base}}/audit-logs?action=TRANSFER_REJECTED

###
GET {{base}}/audit-logs?outcome=SUCCESS&actorUserId=1
